"doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/PlayerManagerDelegate\/pictureInPictureControls(with:)","title":"pictureInPictureControls(with:)","url":"\/documentation\/ovkit\/playermanagerdelegate\/pictureinpicturecontrols(with:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"pictureInPictureControls"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CGRect","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CGRect"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)UIView","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UIView"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Контролы для использования в режиме “Картинка в Картинке”."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"pictureInPictureControlsWith:"}],"required":true,"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://onevideo.OVKit/documentation/OVKit/PlayerControlsViewProtocol":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PlayerControlsViewProtocol","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/PlayerControlsViewProtocol","url":"\/documentation\/ovkit\/playercontrolsviewprotocol","abstract":[{"text":"Базовый протокол для контролов, которые могут использоваться в плеере.","type":"text"}],"title":"PlayerControlsViewProtocol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PlayerControlsViewProtocol","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://onevideo.OVKit/documentation/OVKit/Statistics":{"role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/Statistics","url":"\/documentation\/ovkit\/statistics","abstract":[{"text":"Сбор статистики воспроизведения видео.","type":"text"}],"title":"Статистика","kind":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://onevideo.OVKit/documentation/OVKit/ControlCode/fullscreen":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/Co